1. btop
-------

Portions of the CPU and memory collectors (and, in later phases, disk, network,
GPU, sensor and process collectors) are derived from btop:

    Project:   btop — Resource monitor
    Author:    Aristocratos (jakob@qvantnet.com) and btop contributors
    Version:   commit 956050716f290f529cd51d271b3d7e36eb1a22f0 (2026-09-01)
    Source:    https://github.com/aristocratos/btop
    License:   Apache License, Version 2.0 (text below)

The vendored files carry their original copyright headers. The collection
logic (/proc and /sys parsing and math) is kept from btop; terminal user
interface couplings (drawing, input, menu, theme, config, logging, formatting)
are not used and have been replaced with Qt-native equivalents.

